title: "GeoJAX"
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  GeoJAX is a JAX-native scientific toolkit for Riemannian geometry,
  manifold optimization, and statistical and machine learning with
  manifold-valued data.
keywords:
  - "Riemannian geometry"
  - "manifold optimization"
  - "manifold-valued data"
  - "statistical learning"
  - "JAX"
